# gcp.yaml carries Cloud SQL + Vertex service-account key paths and the Azure
# application secret. It is staged into the build context by the operator before
# `docker build` (same convention as xtimator-page-classifier) and must NEVER be
# committed — this repo already has credentials in its history that still need
# rotation. This .gitignore also keeps the otherwise-empty config/ dir tracked so
# the Dockerfile's `COPY config /app/config` has something to copy locally.
gcp.yaml
*.json
